{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/14/7470792/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブ頃から\n一部メンバーから呼ばれてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/14/7470792/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゴリラ界の天使"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/14/7470792/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恐らく生態の種類としては\nゴリラなのだろうけど、\nゴリラだろうとなんだろうと\n天使なのだから...\nうん、喜んでおこう(๑•̀‧̫•́๑)(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウホウホッヾ(◜▿‾ ( ´▿｀ ) ‾▿◝)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週のNOGIBINGO!3は\n宝塚歌劇団ならぬ乃木の塚歌劇団"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/14/7470792/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蘭世が収録中ずっと\nうっとりしてました(◌•ω•◌ )(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もちょこっと出ているので\n来週もお楽しみに(๑•̀‧̫•́๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1stアルバム カップリング人気投票\n中間結果が発表されました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/11/14/7470792/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://www.nogizaka46.com/album/1st_special/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっかちや、ロマイカが上位なのは\nさすが人気曲！\nといったところですね(๑￣∀￣)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph",